WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.510
Who are you?

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.020
Coffee can't turn into tea,

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.020
and cake can't turn into jelly.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.520
They'll either just disappear

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.530
or rot and fade away.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.780
Did you do this?

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.990
What did you do?

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:36.370
The world is destined

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.700
for a cruel fate,
one filled with despair.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.120
Everything leads to a closed world.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:49.130
Humans must rectify
this mistaken destiny.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.710
What are you talking about?

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:53.510
In order to change
the hopeless future

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:58.890
it is necessary to have the power
to choose an ideal world.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:01.600
Choose the world?

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.350
-Are you--?
-Gnosis!?

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:10.110
Asahi Kuga grew a lot
while with you.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.440
On behalf of all mankind,
I'd like to thank you,

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.610
stars of Subaru.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:17.530
You bastard!

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:27.670
Time went backwards?

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.420
Did he do this?

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:37.130
The Senses from Union can be used
in reality, as well as in the game.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:41.260
Asahi, we've got to hurry
and log in.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:08.000
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:20.860
Creeping Nightmare

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:25.030
MEMORY

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:35.790
I saw it!

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.510
Clive and Nozomi,
stop it from moving!

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.420
Satsuki, attack its eyes with ice!

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.840
Takanori, disintegrate its shell
from behind!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.930
Haruto, attack its back!

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.020
I will deal the final blow!

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.890
Change of plan!

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:53.150
Satsuki!
Hit its shell with lightning!

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.110
Crimson Lightning!

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:04.700
Everyone,
attack before it regenerates!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:16.670
Thousand Edge!

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.760
It worked.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.560
Not bad.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:31.640
Why did you interfere?

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.980
I didn't interfere.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.310
Yes, you did!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.150
You changed the plan
after I gave the order!

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.740
I didn't think it would work.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.070
You don't trust me?

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.780
Stop it!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:52.200
I don't want to see you anymore!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.830
Go away!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:01.460
Asahi!

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:22.230
Hey! Asahi!

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:25.400
Haruto...

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:28.240
Asahi.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.870
You're Haruto, right?

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.830
Are you okay?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.000
Sorry. I had a strange dream.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:43.960
There's still time before we meet up
with the others, right?

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:45.880
Asahi!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.760
Are you okay?

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.390
What's wrong?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.010
Did anything unusual happen?

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:53.640
No...

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.390
I'm glad you're safe.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:58.440
You guys are early.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.520
Is something going on?

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:07.490
So, you're saying a guy from Gnosis
appeared in real life

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.030
and used his Sense?

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.660
That's right.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:17.330
I never thought I'd see someone
use a Sense in real life.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.420
I know it's hard to believe...

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.210
No. I believe you.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.550
He's probably the real enemy.
The one Elicia was talking about.

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:31.550
As long as he's after Asahi,
we're the ones holding the cards.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.140
But, if he's going interfere
in real life...

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.810
that's a different story.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.560
Elicia was trying to awaken us.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:43.940
She didn't tell me why,
but it's probably...

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.490
It's probably related to this.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.570
Maybe Asahi wanted to reunite Subaru

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.200
because she saw something
subconsciously.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.080
But still...

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:58.250
Why did he bother appearing
before us?

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.830
I can think of one reason...

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.680
Everyone, run away!
Run away from this base!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.050
What's wrong, Asahi?

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.730
We were just in time.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.150
They tried to get us in one place
to destroy us all at once.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.240
They've started to play rough.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.740
Hey. What's that?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.120
It looks exactly like

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.290
the Tower of the White Water Spirit
we cleared six years ago.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.580
You're right, it does look the same.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.920
There's only one person
who could make that.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:49.720
Yeah. Nozomi's in there.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.730
I don't sense any monsters.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:08.900
It's just like that castle
the other day.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.380
The structure of this dungeon
is exactly like

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.430
the Tower of the White Water Spirit.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.860
Is something wrong, Asahi?

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:51.900
No. It's nothing.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.610
-But--
-I said, it's nothing!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.580
This is where the mini-boss appeared
last time.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.250
I believe it was a giant serpent.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:14.050
Takanori! Duck!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:26.560
What's wrong?

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:31.190
There was a monster there,
and its tail was about to hit you...

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:37.820
That door...

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.790
That door opened last time,
after we beat the mini-boss.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.660
It's like it's in debug mode.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.670
Asahi, what was that just now?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.290
Asahi? Hey!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.300
Takanori. Can you destroy that wall?

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:59.050
I've been analyzing it for a while,
so it won't take me that long.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:02.680
Asahi's acting strange.
Let's go back.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.230
Go back? We've already made it
more than half-way.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.900
There's nothing wrong with me.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.980
But, the Prophet Art
isn't working right.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.860
No, this place looks exactly
the same as last time! That's why--

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:20.780
Calm down. You're just shaken up
because our base was destroyed.

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:25.250
I'm not shaken up!
We have to save Nozomi!

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.750
Hey, Asahi.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.460
Asahi!

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:51.770
We're almost at the top floor.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:56.280
If it's the same as before,
the final boss is there.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.700
Well, then...

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:09.540
Just as I thought.
It's the same as six years ago.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:14.540
But that disgusting crayfish
is gone.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.260
Asahi!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.640
You're earlier than I expected.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.140
Nozomi.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.320
Nozomi, come home with us!

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:48.700
You still think I'm going to go back
to being friends with you?

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.710
You're hopeless.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.580
That's so typical of you though.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.590
What happened, Nozomi?

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:59.210
You destroyed our base?
That's not who you are!

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:01.840
So what?

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:07.600
I went to you this time.
You should be thanking me.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:13.350
But it's full of our old memories!
It's an important place to you, too!

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:17.110
Memories?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:21.110
If they had stayed memories,
that might have been true.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.950
Snap out of it!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:28.870
Nozomi! Gnosis is controlling you
through your negative emotions!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.750
So?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:36.790
Grudges, hate, everyone has them,
right?

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.590
-Are you saying that you guys don't?
-Nozomi...

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:44.720
Back then, I was just pretending
to be a good girl.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:48.220
-Closed up in my shell.
-Shell?

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:51.770
Nozomi, you're...

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:56.230
I'm tired of talking about this!

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:57.480
Nozomi!

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:03.650
Come, my dear familiars.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:07.240
Eternity Break!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.500
This is kind of heavy.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:16.080
Sorry, Clive.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.580
And...

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.890
I was able to change.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.640
I can do things like this now.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:36.020
-What is that?
-No way. Are you really Nozomi?

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.690
That's right.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:41.400
I don't have to cower in fear
like I used to.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.490
I don't have to hide inside my shell.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.910
I gained freedom!

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.160
That's not freedom!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.290
I know how you feel
because I used to be the same.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.290
My friends helped me
understand that.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:57.540
So...

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.420
Nozomi, I'm going to save you
this time!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.640
Welcome, all!
I'm so grateful to you all!

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:13.520
We meet again, Subaru.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:16.600
I don't know what you did,

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:19.020
but there's nothing
I can't disintegrate.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.520
I'll turn you all to dust,
along with

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.400
the Sense that's killing Nozomi!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:29.530
You're so cool! I'm impressed!
Go ahead and try!

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.120
Nozomi, are you ready?

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.450
Crush them!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:37.410
Protect Asahi!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.540
Ash Break!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.170
Million Edge!

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.300
Leonidas!

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.300
Flames of Eternal Dominion!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:49.430
There's no end to this.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:53.390
Why can't I use the Prophet Art
at a time like this?

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:57.270
Would everyone do what you say
if you could use it?

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:02.310
It happened in a dungeon
exactly like this one. Haruto...

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:03.820
Stop!

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.070
What's wrong, Asahi?

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:08.700
Well, then it's about time.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:10.820
Haruto!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:15.950
I'm a Dreamworld Sense
war museum.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:20.250
Reverberate! Military March!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.090
Nozomi?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.970
I knew it.
You two are always together.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:36.470
Nozomi, listen.
You have it all wrong!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.980
I should have never logged in.

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.740
I could have just kept it
as a good memory.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:51.240
Don't attack.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:56.370
Nozomi, I'll risk my life
to stop you!

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.210
Breaker!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:07.880
Takanori!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.600
What are you doing?

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:21.810
Haruto is in trouble,
and Asahi is about to...

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.520
I wanted to talk to you alone.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.270
-Talk?
-About the past.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:30.280
Or what you've been doing
for six years, anything.

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.780
You still think I'm the same
as back then?

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.030
Why didn't you dodge?

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.660
I don't deserve

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.960
to dodge your attacks.

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.460
What are you saying?

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.470
Stay back!

00:16:55.510 --> 00:17:01.020
Remember? We got lost together
in a dungeon six years ago.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.530
I'm sorry.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:15.070
It's my fault.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.990
Don't worry about it.
They'll find us soon.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.870
Let's believe in our friends.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:26.710
Why am I always like this?
I always hold everyone back.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:31.380
I thought I might be able
to change myself in this world.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.670
Do you want to change?

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.010
Yes, I want to change.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:41.510
I don't want to cause trouble
for everyone.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.180
I want to have fun with everyone.

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:52.110
If you're not satisfied
with the way you are.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.200
If you want to change,
don't lock yourself in your shell.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.030
Break out of your shell.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:58.950
My shell?

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:05.500
Back there, I told you not
to lock yourself in your shell.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:10.250
But I'm the one who couldn't
break out of his shell.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.420
What are you talking about?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:17.430
I knew. I knew I always loved Asahi.

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:23.470
It hurt that she never had feelings
for me.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:29.520
The pain stayed in my heart,
and grew into something ugly.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.270
But, at the dance...
You were with Satsuki...

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:34.530
We were just comforting each other.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:39.410
Me and Satsuki both lost
to Haruto and Asahi on that day.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:46.500
I know it was a misunderstanding,
but we ended up hurting you.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.170
I'm really sorry.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:52.420
It's too late. It's too late!

00:18:54.670 --> 00:19:00.010
It's too late! Telling me now
just makes me feel horrible!

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.930
Right now...

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.850
I know how you feel.
More than anyone else!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.770
Stop.

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:15.940
I was too caught up
in my own feelings,

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.820
and I didn't notice.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:20.700
-I'm sorry for everything!
-Stop.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:22.240
Stop!

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:28.450
Why?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:32.040
I had them send us back
to the Dreamworld.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.380
No way. The Divinity Sense

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:38.380
can't transport things
if they're hostile.

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:42.930
I finally reached you.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.610
I'm angry.

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:59.110
I know. I...

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:03.950
No. I'm mad at myself
for not noticing your feelings.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:09.250
Nozomi, back then you were kind
to everyone.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.580
You were always happy
to help others.

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:18.590
You were more noble than anyone
in Subaru.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:23.430
I wanted you to see me.

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:26.890
After changing schools,
I tried really hard.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:30.390
I wanted you to see me differently
from how I used to be.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:34.850
I thought, "This time..."
But...

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.730
It's not too late.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.950
I'll carry it all.
Your crime, and my punishment.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:48.370
I remove this evil Sense
that's possessing you!

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:17.560
No! I-- What did I do?

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.110
I made a terrible mistake.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.650
-It's okay.
-But...

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:27.990
I finally noticed
that you are a part of me.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:33.910
I want to be with you from now on.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:43.420
Let's go back, Nozomi.
To our friends in Subaru.

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:45.430
Yeah.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:54.060
-What's wrong?
-No. Asahi...

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.330
Why...?

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:22.130
No.

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:58.060
-Haruto?
-Haruto!

00:23:58.220 --> 00:24:01.770
Haruto!

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:07.360
Episode 12, "The New Legend."
